Event Mesh :
------------
An event mesh is a network of interconnected event brokers that facilitates real-time,
asynchronous communication between applications, services, and devices. It enables applications
to publish and subscribe to events, regardless of their location (e.g., on-premise, in a private
cloud, or public cloud). Essentially, it's a logical layer that enhances communication capabilities,
often using the publish/subscribe (pub/sub) patter

